Implemented ticket #172 without committing or pushing.

Key changes:

- Implementer sessions now persist between loop iterations via `adapter.Resume`.
- Iteration 1 always uses a fresh `adapter.Run`.
- Resume failures fall back to a fresh run with the same composed iteration prompt.
- Blocking findings remain included in resumed prompts.
- Implementer session IDs continue to be recorded per iteration.
- Existing HEAD-unchanged guard remains intact.
- Updated orchestration and CLI integration tests for resume and fallback behavior.

Files changed include [implement.go](/Users/igorrocha/workspace/personal/my-harness/internal/orchestration/implement.go:301) and [recorder_test.go](/Users/igorrocha/workspace/personal/my-harness/internal/orchestration/recorder_test.go:182).

The vendored `implement`, `tdd`, and `code-quality` guidance shaped the test-first implementation and verification.

